# Self-test fixture (rbe-worker S2 scaffolding), paired with
# platforms/BUILD.bazel and tools/rbe/worker-env.txt: the one line
# cmd/product-check's worker items check against worker/worker-env's own
# default (WORKER_ENV_PATH). gascity and beads commit the real file at this
